{"id":"b07023840bdaf7be","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PresInductionRaw.md","title":"PresInductionRaw","display":"PresInductionRaw","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PresInductionRaw","parameters":["out"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PresInductionRaw"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>out</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>out</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PresInductionRaw out)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists phi\n  (exists vx\n    (exists tz\n      (exists ts\n        (exists basecase\n          (exists stepcase\n            (and\n              (@ PresFm phi)\n              (and\n                (@ Nat vx)\n                (and\n                  (exists z4660\n                    (exists z4661\n                      (exists z4662\n                        (and (@ Num0 z4660) (and (@ Num0 z4662) (and (@ Seq z4661 z4662) (@ FFun z4660 z4661 tz)))))))\n                  (and\n                    (exists z4663\n                      (exists z4664\n                        (exists z4665\n                          (exists z4666\n                            (exists z4667\n                            (and\n                            (@ Num1 z4663)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Num1 z4665)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Seq z4664 z4665)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4668 (and (= vx z4668) (@ FVar z4668 z4666)))\n                            (and (@ Num0 z4667) (and (@ App z4664 z4667 z4666) (@ FFun z4663 z4664 ts))))))))))))\n                    (and\n                      (@ PresSub vx tz phi basecase)\n                      (and\n                        (@ PresSub vx ts phi stepcase)\n                        (exists z4669\n                          (exists z4670\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4671\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4672\n                            (exists z4673\n                            (and\n                            (= basecase z4672)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4674\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4675\n                            (exists z4676\n                            (and\n                            (= vx z4675)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4677 (exists z4678 (and (= phi z4677) (and (= stepcase z4678) (@ PImp z4677 z4678 z4676)))))\n                            (@ FAll z4675 z4676 z4674)))))\n                            (@ PNeg z4674 z4673)))\n                            (@ PImp z4672 z4673 z4671)))))\n                            (@ PNeg z4671 z4669)))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4679 (exists z4680 (and (= vx z4679) (and (= phi z4680) (@ FAll z4679 z4680 z4670)))))\n                            (@ PImp z4669 z4670 out)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b01633bdf3140514\" href=\"?note=b01633bdf3140514\" title=\"ZFC_FAll\">FAll</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140c6359fed2eb8a\" href=\"?note=140c6359fed2eb8a\" title=\